Fonts

The browser application specifies no webfont. It uses whatever the reader's own
system provides through the generic families system-ui, Georgia and a monospace
fallback, so no font file is redistributed here.

Report rendering inside the container uses the DejaVu fonts, installed from the
operating system package, and the Lohit Devanagari font for Hindi text. Neither is
vendored into this repository.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Sample images

web/assets/inspection-hero.jpeg and the images under web/samples/ are used to
illustrate the interface and the analysis pipeline. They depict no real product,
premises, brand or identifiable person, and every synthetic label generated by the
test suites is marked "(SAMPLE DATA)" in the image itself.
